<title>UK: Berlin-Hannoversche Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Berlin-Hannoversche Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager WGZ-Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERLIN-HANNOVERSCHE HYPOTHKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.25     MATURITY   *10.SEP.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    10.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    BERLIN/HANNOVER</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 10.SEP.97 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR STEPS-UP TO</p>
<p>		 4.875 PCT.</p>
<p>		*OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 71</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
